# The source is the document

```ruby
class Presentation
  def reorder(from, to)
    slides.insert(to, slides.delete_at(from))
  end
end
```

---

# One folder

| Directory | Contents |
| :--- | :--- |
| images/ | Pictures and backgrounds |
| videos/ | Local videos |
| presentation.md | Your slides |
